#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Settings: how many posts reach the page, how long they stay cached, and the colours of the timeline."
msgstr "Impostazioni: quanti post arrivano in pagina, quanto restano in cache e i colori della timeline."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Settings: one box per platform, with the fields and the display options that apply to it."
msgstr "Impostazioni: un riquadro per piattaforma, con i campi e le opzioni di resa che la riguardano."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Cards carry image previews and interaction counts where the source provides them."
msgstr "Le schede portano anteprime immagini e contatori di interazione dove la fonte li fornisce."

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "The timeline on the site: one chronological feed from every source, with the compact filter bar on top."
msgstr "La timeline sul sito: un unico flusso cronologico da tutte le fonti, con la barra filtri compatta in cima."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Fixed: a custom colour for the filter bar is now shown as chosen."
msgstr "Fixed: a custom colour for the filter bar is now shown as chosen."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Fixed: two timelines on the same page no longer share their filters."
msgstr "Fixed: two timelines on the same page no longer share their filters."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "New: a Filter Bar section in the settings: the bar can be visible, collapsible or hidden, full or compact, with its own background. The <code>filters</code> shortcode attribute sets it page by page."
msgstr "New: a Filter Bar section in the settings: the bar can be visible, collapsible or hidden, full or compact, with its own background. The <code>filters</code> shortcode attribute sets it page by page."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "New: the shortcode takes a <code>layout</code> attribute to choose list or grid page by page, e.g. <code>[eg_social_timeline layout=\"grid\" limit=\"20\"]</code>."
msgstr "New: the shortcode takes a <code>layout</code> attribute to choose list or grid page by page, e.g. <code>[eg_social_timeline layout=\"grid\" limit=\"20\"]</code>."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "New: grid layout, in Settings → Appearance → Layout. Cards sit side by side in as many columns as fit, one column on phones; images are cropped to 16:9. The platform filters keep working."
msgstr "New: grid layout, in Settings → Appearance → Layout. Cards sit side by side in as many columns as fit, one column on phones; images are cropped to 16:9. The platform filters keep working."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Fixed: after changing a profile, the diagnostics table no longer shows the last result of the previous one."
msgstr "Fixed: after changing a profile, the diagnostics table no longer shows the last result of the previous one."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Changed: saving the settings is faster. Only the profiles you added or changed are checked, so changing a colour or the layout makes no request; the \"Verify profiles\" button still checks them all."
msgstr "Changed: saving the settings is faster. Only the profiles you added or changed are checked, so changing a colour or the layout makes no request; the \"Verify profiles\" button still checks them all."

#. Found in changelog list item.
msgid "Changed: new description in the plugin directory and in the plugins list."
msgstr "Changed: new description in the plugin directory and in the plugins list."

